# Throwaway measurement specs. This project writes them constantly --
# "does this actually overflow", "what does the register paint" -- and
# they exist for one command before being deleted. A formatter complaining
# about a probe is noise, and a probe that reaches a commit is a mistake
# the ignore below catches rather than hides.
tests/tmp-*.spec.mjs
# The release asset the workflow builds from fonts/ [AR39].
fonts.tar
consumer.tar
